   "message": "Bound source notes misdescribe the cited works. hec-2013-practicum.md note 3 claims the handbook (pp. 17-21) specifies permission, confidentiality and anonymity requirements; the 45-page handbook contains no occurrence of ethic, confidential, anonym, permission, consent, privacy or respect, yet coverage/unit-01.md maps U1-04 (ethics) only to it. Note 1 (systematic inquiry, non-punitive) and note 6 (constructive, evidence-based feedback, targets, pp. 39-45) cite wording the handbook lacks; note 2 places role summaries on pp. 12-16 (they are pp. 18-19). teach-primary-2021.md note 3 claims halo, severity and leniency errors on pp. 26-42 (the manual never uses those terms; its bias passage is pp. 15-16; PDF pp. 26-42 are rubric elements) and note 4 claims tally aggregation and feedback procedures on pp. 43-52 (those are the checklist and FAQ). REPAIR: rewrite the notes from the works with correct pages; bind a source that treats observation ethics for U1-04 or record that section as author guidance in coverage and sources. No prose change needed."
